      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Please do not rely on ibuprofen for these symptoms; it will not treat potential preeclampsia and could be risky. The flickering lights are a neurological symptom that needs professional evaluation, not just rest. Since you are concerned, a quick call to your midwife or OB-GYN is the safest step, even if it is late. They can advise you on whether an immediate check-up is necessary.",
